    {"at": "trailhead", "title": "Rules of the road", "text": "One party at a time. The waves come to you; the road behind stays quiet once you have cleared it. Fall and you rise at the last fire you passed. The waystones count you out."},
    {"at": "heron-pool", "title": "The pilgrims' pool", "text": "Pilgrims washed here before the last climb to Harrowcrag. The herons still fish it. Nothing else of the pilgrims is left."}
